#. <CLT 4>モノクマが写るモニター…
#. 厨房にまで置いてあるのか…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0001 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>This is one of the monitors Monokuma appears on. They\n"
"even put them in the kitchen...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>いつモノクマが出てくるかと思うと、
#. うかうか料理なんて出来ないな…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0002 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>It's impossible to cook in here without thinking about\n"
"how he could reappear any second...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>この監視カメラ…
#. 厨房にまで置いてあるのか…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0003 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>There's a surveillance camera in the kitchen, too...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>モノクマに見られてると思うと、
#. 料理に集中なんて出来なさそうだ。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0004 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Knowing Monokuma could be watching me, there's no way\n"
"I could concentrate on cooking anything.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>大小、様々な大きさな包丁が取り揃えられている。
#. でも…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0005 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>There are all kinds of kitchen knives here, big to\n"
"small. But...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>包丁が…１本足りないみたいだ。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0006 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>It looks like one of them is missing.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>これって最初からなかったのか？
#. それとも…？
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0007 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Was it missing from the very beginning, or...?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>この厨房に詳しい人がいれば、
#. 話を聞いてみたいところだけど…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0008 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I'd better see if anyone here knows more about it.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 23><CLT><CLT 3>厨房の包丁セット<CLT><CLT 23>を手帳に記録しました。
#. 言弾（コトダマ）メニューで確認できます。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0009 | NARRATION"
msgid ""
"<CLT 23>\"<CLT><CLT 3>Kitchen Knife Set<CLT><CLT 23>\" has been added to the Truth\n"
"Bullets section of your handbook.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>霜降りだ！　霜降り肉だ！
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0010 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Marbled meats! Salted meats!\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>…って、それどころじゃないな。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0011 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>...Now's no time to be thinking about food.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>野菜が山積みになっている…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0012 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>There's a bunch of vegetables all piled up.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>特に気になる事はないな…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0013 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I don't see anything noteworthy about any of it.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. はい
msgctxt "0014 | CHOICE/RE:ACT"
msgid "Yes"
msgstr ""

#. いいえ
msgctxt "0015 | CHOICE/RE:ACT"
msgid "No"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 23>厨房から出ますか？
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0016 | NARRATION"
msgid ""
"<CLT 23>Leave the kitchen?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""
